     "sections": [
      "S2_thermal_testing",
      "S5_customer_disclosure"
     ],
     "comparison": "Endorses S5 without a numeric mandatory recall trigger (weakened, benefits Halcyon) while Version 15's S2 carries an 8% interim cap (weakened, benefits Northwind). Implicit acceptance of the cross-section package."
    }
