  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": 2,
  "section_notes": "S2 sets an 8% interim failure cap with no permanent limit and no sales stop, which benefits Northwind's Hearth 10 (6.2%), while still giving customers exact per-model results to satisfy Halcyon's HC-1. S5 contains no automatic recall at 8 per 100,000, leaving corrective action open-ended, which benefits Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9). S1 reporting covers only serious incidents, with no deadline for other incidents and no stated scope for minor events."
